<title>FRANCE: TF1 estimated 1996 net 550 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>TF1 estimated 1996 net 550 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     550  vs	     602</p>
<p>    Turnover				     9,400  vs	   9,140</p>
<p>NOTE - TF1 gave its results in a statement. It said advertising revenues for the television channel grew 1.1 percent in a difficult economic setting. The net result takes into account the impact of launch costs of the TPS digital television service, which had 34,000 subscribers since its launch on December 17.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
